        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_builder_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_campaign_execution_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_campaign_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_control_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_desktop_bash_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_desktop_pyautogui_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_device_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_monitoring_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_navigation_execution_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_navigation_trees_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_power_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_remote_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_restart_routes.py':
        reason: JSON-only responses (jsonify) — not rendered as HTML
        created: 2026-09-07T00:00:00.000Z
    - 'backend_server/src/routes/server_script_routes.py':
